+      "occurredAt": 1788359905420,
+      "originSeq": 1318,
+      "eventType": "next_step_created",
+      "schemaVersion": 1,
+      "authorUserId": null,
+      "owner": "Forge",
+      "disposition": "carried-unchanged-not-absorbed"
+    },
+    {
+      "id": 1319,
+      "content": "Correct the B-15 recipe in the record: as written ('remove dist/schemas/component-schema.json from the extracted tarball') the payload-tree digest check at e2e.mjs:504 fires before the MCP client is built at :541, so a reviewer re-running it verbatim sees a digest mismatch and never observes the list-succeeds/call-fails discrimination the row exists to prove. The builder measured it correctly with the embedded manifest re-pinned; the recipe needs that step.",
