+      "occurredAt": 1788359905420,
+      "originSeq": 1319,
+      "eventType": "next_step_created",
+      "schemaVersion": 1,
+      "authorUserId": null,
+      "owner": "Forge",
+      "disposition": "carried-unchanged-not-absorbed"
+    },
+    {
+      "id": 1320,
+      "content": "Widen boundary gate 3 (the quoted-'cmos' executable check at assemble.mjs:512) beyond /^packages/[^/]+/dist/.*\\.js$/ so it covers the adapter's four flat runtime files at packages/mcp-adapter/*.js. Latent and currently clean — gates 1 and 2 do cover those files.",
