+          "screenreader": "Sortable column headers use button role with aria-sort attribute\n(ascending, descending, or none). On activation, the new sort state\nis announced via aria-live region (e.g., \"Sorted by Name, ascending\").\nNon-sortable columns do not have interactive sort controls.\n"
+        },
