+# Sprint 182 M04 caller migration ledger
+
+Date: 2026-09-03
+Authority: `cmos/planning/forge-s182-product-reality-foundation-decision-memo.md` §s182-m04 and `cmos/planning/forge-s182-foundation-gate-manifest.md` B-11/B-14/B-15.
+
+This ledger records the explicit disposition of direct `code.generate`/`pipeline` caller families. It does not expand the supported nucleus, claim `foundation-v1-candidate` or `foundation-v1`, or reinterpret the bounded saved schema as a generalized schema compiler.
+
+## Caller dispositions
+
