+| Error registry | No `OODS-N015` registry assertion. | `OODS-N015` resolves to category `not_found`, message `Component target unavailable`, and `retryable: false`. | `packages/mcp-server/test/contracts/error-observability.contract.spec.ts` |
+| Governed repeatability (B-14) | General deterministic-source coverage existed without the locked M04 carrier. | Independent repeated React and Vue requests compare emitted bytes and a canonical digest of the existing complete response evidence; the response schema is not extended. | `packages/mcp-server/src/tools/__tests__/code.generate.test.ts` |
