+| Product-reality generation and packed consumers | No M04-wide 12-cell compile matrix or submitted-tarball generated-consumer proof existed. | The evidence runner, matrix carrier, and packed-consumer carrier consume the public result shape directly, require real target/CSS imports, and fail rather than treating an error result as usable source. | `scripts/product-reality/run-s182-m04-evidence.ts`; `packages/mcp-server/test/product-reality/codegen-matrix.s182.spec.ts`; `packages/mcp-server/test/product-reality/packed-consumers.s182.spec.ts`; `scripts/product-reality/s182-m04-consumer-harness.mjs` |
+| Golden fixtures | Dashboard, form, and detail fixtures asserted generated React/Vue source containing components without emission evidence. | Each operand asserts its exact ordered `OODS-N015` response. The six impossible source goldens are replaced by three framework-neutral `.n015.json` outcomes. | `packages/mcp-server/test/contracts/code.generate-golden.spec.ts`; `packages/mcp-server/test/fixtures/codegen/dashboard-page.n015.json`; `packages/mcp-server/test/fixtures/codegen/form-page.n015.json`; `packages/mcp-server/test/fixtures/codegen/detail-page.n015.json` |
+| `viz.compose` / Chart | The composed visualization schema was expected to generate React source despite known-unready visualization controls. | Composition, registry validation, and rendering remain successful; React generation returns the exact seven-node `OODS-N015` list in document preorder. | `packages/mcp-server/test/compose/viz-compose.spec.ts` |
+| Object codegen | Subscription/User detail/list and dashboard operands asserted React/Vue source for known-unready domain components. | Object composition, traits, fields, `objectSchema`, context-specific root bindings, validation, and multiple rendered domain markers remain covered. Only React/Vue emission is reclassified to the exact ordered `OODS-N015` set for each operand. | `packages/mcp-server/test/e2e/object-codegen-pipeline.spec.ts` |
