+| Token injection | Raw emitter tests asserted token override CSS/comments. | Remains below tool preflight and continues to exercise token serialization; no unavailable-component success is claimed. | `packages/mcp-server/test/compose/token-injection.spec.ts` |
+| Low-level emitters and normalization | Raw emitter suites expected local generated component modules and legacy props/bindings. | They remain intentionally below capability preflight, import real packages/CSS, and directly cover locked normalization: explicit ID once (including object-field rebuild), `readonly` → `readOnly`, deterministic table row IDs, legacy and child-panel Tabs lowering, visible Card body, and Vue update events. | `packages/mcp-server/test/codegen/react-emitter.spec.ts`; `packages/mcp-server/test/codegen/vue-emitter.spec.ts`; `packages/mcp-server/test/codegen/cross-framework-parity.spec.ts`; `packages/mcp-server/test/codegen/prop-binding.spec.ts`; `tests/codegen/react-emitter.test.ts`; `tests/codegen/vue-emitter.test.ts` |
