+`packages/mcp-server/.oods/schemas/tier1-acceptance-sub-detail.json` is intentionally ignored by the repository-wide `**/.oods/` rule. It must be staged explicitly with `git add -f` at the coherent commit boundary; the ignore policy must not be broadened.
