diff --git a/docs/how-forge-works.html b/docs/how-forge-works.html
index a428e70..78ae0d0 100644
--- a/docs/how-forge-works.html
+++ b/docs/how-forge-works.html
@@ -115 +115 @@
-  <p>Everything lives in one repository as plain files: traits and objects are YAML (<span class="k">traits/</span>, <span class="k">objects/</span>, <span class="k">domains/</span>), tokens are JSON (<span class="k">packages/tokens/src/tokens/</span>), components are React (<span class="k">src/components/</span>), and the tools are a local server (<span class="k">packages/mcp-server/</span>). A <b>tool</b> is a typed function — name plus JSON in, JSON out — that you call over the Model Context Protocol from an AI assistant, over HTTP from a panel, or from the command line. Nothing requires a hosted service.</p>
+  <p>Everything lives in one repository as plain files: traits and objects are YAML (<span class="k">traits/</span>, <span class="k">objects/</span>, <span class="k">domains/</span>), tokens are JSON (<span class="k">packages/tokens/src/tokens/</span>), components are packaged for React and Vue (<span class="k">packages/components-react/</span>, <span class="k">packages/components-vue/</span>) with shared styles (<span class="k">packages/component-styles/</span>), and the tools are a local server (<span class="k">packages/mcp-server/</span>). A <b>tool</b> is a typed function — name plus JSON in, JSON out — that you call over the Model Context Protocol from an AI assistant, over HTTP from a panel, or from the command line. Nothing requires a hosted service.</p>
@@ -277 +277 @@ schema:   <span class="cmt"># Product's own fields</span>
-  <p>The catalog holds about 100 registered components, almost all contributed by traits (93 of them declare which trait uses them): status badges and timelines, price summaries, classification panels, address editors, audit timelines, tag managers, chart previews and controls, plus primitives — Button, Card, Checkbox, DatePicker, Badge, Banner. There are 83 React component source files and a Storybook of 400+ stories covering light, dark and high-contrast. <span class="k">catalog.list</span> filters the catalog by category, trait or context; <span class="k">object show</span> returns an object's composed traits and extensions.</p>
+  <p>The canonical intake contains 109 unique component claims. The current reconciliation proposal classifies 98 as runtime component rows (15 native and 83 recipes) and 11 as non-runtime authoring-only rows. All 109 remain pending Derek approval, so 109 is still the controlling obligation denominator. Sprint-182 evidence marks exactly 14 React and 14 Vue surface cells as <span class="k">foundation-v1-candidate</span>; those candidates require a separate independent review, and none is promoted to <span class="k">foundation-v1</span> yet. The exact cross-framework nucleus is Badge, Banner, Button, Card, Checkbox, DatePicker, Grid, Input, Select, Stack, Table, Tabs, Text and Textarea. <span class="k">catalog.list</span> filters the catalog by category, trait or context; <span class="k">object show</span> returns an object's composed traits and extensions.</p>
@@ -310 +310 @@ schema:   <span class="cmt"># Product's own fields</span>
-      <tr><td>code.generate</td><td>A validated UiSchema; framework react | vue | html; styling inline | tokens | tailwind; TypeScript on/off.</td><td>One source file as a string (.tsx / .vue / .html) plus its import list. React and Vue import from <span class="k">@oods/components</span> — map that specifier to your build of the component library; HTML is standalone.</td></tr>
+      <tr><td>code.generate</td><td>A validated UiSchema; framework react | vue | html; styling inline | tokens | tailwind; TypeScript on/off.</td><td>One source file as a string (.tsx / .vue / .html) plus its import list. React imports the real <span class="k">@oods/components-react</span> package, Vue imports <span class="k">@oods/components-vue</span>, and both import <span class="k">@oods/component-styles/css</span>. A known component/target pair that is not emission-eligible fails before emission with typed error <span class="k">OODS-N015</span> and no source payload; HTML remains standalone.</td></tr>
